@vsm 0.3
V(root,L0)>V(Manager,L1)>V(NP_Worker,L2)|V(P_Worker,L2)
Manager:   A[autonomy<0.85, trust>0.4]  φ↑(child_halt)
NP_Worker: A[autonomy<0.75, entropy<0.80]
